Package: qore-msgpack-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-msgpack-module-doc
Description: MessagePack serialization module for Qore
 This module encodes and decodes MessagePack data, with extension types and
 a Qore-specific mode that preserves additional Qore value types.
 Compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools.

Package: qore-msgpack-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-msgpack-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's msgpack module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 MessagePack serialization module.
